OL,3,GNEWSAThe men who sent themselves
OL,4,Athrough the post
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne man wanted to test an unusual
OL,7,Fpostal loophole after reading about it
OL,8,Fin a newspaper while another was
OL,9,Fdesperate to get home to his family as
OL,10,Fwar spread across Europe.
OL,12,FMore than 30 years apart, Harry Turner
OL,13,Fand Major "Peabod" Palmer both
OL,14,Ftravelled between Channel Islands by
OL,15,Fpost.
OL,17,FIn 1905, Guernsey resident Turner
OL,18,Fdecided to find out whether the postal
OL,19,Fsystem could really be used to
OL,20,Ftransport a person - it had previously
OL,21,Fbeen done by a man in London in 1900.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
