OL,3,GNEWSAThe men who sent themselves
OL,4,Athrough the post
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter reading a newspaper article about
OL,7,Fthe rules, he arranged to be sent from
OL,8,FGuernsey to Sark as a postal item,
OL,9,Fbecoming what is believed to have been
OL,10,Fthe first person ever to post himself.
